0111\xe3i v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i","background":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/ta/bb/0d/2d/89b0542829f0e6b003379498a64a90e0.png","text_color":"#FFFFFF","dynamic_banner":{"id":"cart_upgrade_gold","type":"top_banner","background":"linear-gradient(111.48deg, #FFCB45 -54.03%, #E27F30 123.7%)","layout_direction":"horizontal","padding":{"top":0,"right":12,"bottom":0,"left":16},"data":[{"type":"image","src":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/ta/b1/8b/65/8e94eb6959c39109b04f5858d4c83c19.png","width":{"value":30,"unit":"px"}},{"type":"block","padding":{"top":12,"right":8,"bottom":12,"left":8},"items":[{"type":"text","data":[{"font_size":"font_size_small","color":"255, 255, 255, 100","text":"M\u1edf kh\xf3a h\u1ea1ng V\xe0ng v\xe0 nh\u1eadn \u01b0u \u0111\xe3i v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i"}]}]},{"type":"image","src":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/ta/27/8d/89/37852372ab38a20b3a1cdd9de888506a.png","width":{"value":24,"unit":"px"}}]}},"diamond":{"icon":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/ta/b1/8b/65/8e94eb6959c39109b04f5858d4c83c19.png","text":"M\u1edf kh\xf3a h\u1ea1ng Kim C\u01b0\u01a1ng v\xe0 nh\u1eadn \u01b0u \u0111\xe3i v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i","background":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/ta/87/be/20/0190cb6ce21b5eb06a9c2c400376d3df.png","text_color":"#FFEED8","dynamic_banner":{"id":"cart_upgrade_diamond","type":"top_banner","background":"radial-gradient(142.95% 457.3% at -21.03% -23.75%, #1A0D00 0%, #563919 50.88%, #070707 100%)","layout_direction":"horizontal","padding":{"top":0,"right":12,"bottom":0,"left":16},"data":[{"type":"image","src":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/ta/b1/8b/65/8e94eb6959c39109b04f5858d4c83c19.png","width":{"value":30,"unit":"px"}},{"type":"block","padding":{"top":12,"right":8,"bottom":12,"left":8},"items":[{"type":"text","data":[{"font_size":"font_size_small","color":"255, 238, 216, 100","text":"M\u1edf kh\xf3a h\u1ea1ng Kim c\u01b0\u01a1ng v\xe0 nh\u1eadn \u01b0u \u0111\xe3i v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i"}]}]},{"type":"image","src":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/ta/62/72/2a/8db3ab6a7e6319fe451bccdf575a5eef.png","width":{"value":24,"unit":"px"}}]}}},"faq":[{"title":"L\xe0m th\u1ebf n\xe0o \u0111\u1ec3 l\xean h\u1ea1ng V\xe0ng ho\u1eb7c Kim C\u01b0\u01a1ng?","description":"<p style=\'font-size:14px; font-weight:400; line-height:150%; color:#757575;\'>H\u1ea1ng V\xe0ng: Ho\xe0n th\xe0nh t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 03 \u0111\u01a1n h\xe0ng v\xe0 chi ti\xeau t\u1eeb 1,000,000 VND trong k\u1ef3 x\xe9t h\u1ea1ng.<br/>H\u1ea1ng Kim C\u01b0\u01a1ng: Ho\xe0n th\xe0nh t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 10 \u0111\u01a1n h\xe0ng v\xe0 chi ti\xeau t\u1eeb 4,000,000 VND trong k\u1ef3 x\xe9t h\u1ea1ng.<br/>L\u01b0u \xfd: Sau khi b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ee7 c\xe1c \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n, h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng s\u1ebd n\xe2ng h\u1ea1ng trong v\xf2ng 24 gi\u1edd k\u1ec3 t\u1eeb th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m \u0111\u01a1n h\xe0ng \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c giao h\xe0ng th\xe0nh c\xf4ng (GHTC).</p>"},{"title":"Lo\u1ea1i \u0111\u01a1n h\xe0ng n\xe0o s\u1ebd kh\xf4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\xednh v\xe0o t\u1ed5ng chi ti\xeau v\xe0 s\u1ed1 \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u1ec3 x\xe9t h\u1ea1ng?","description":"<ul style=\'font-size:14px; font-weight:400; line-height:150%; color:#757575;\'><li>\u0110\u01a1n h\xe0ng D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5, Voucher & D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5</li><li>\u0110\u01a1n h\xe0ng n\u1ea1p ng\xe2n s\xe1ch TIKI Ads.</li><li>\u0110\u01a1n h\xe0ng vi ph\u1ea1m ch\xednh s\xe1ch c\u1ee7a TIKI.</li><li>\u0110\u01a1n h\xe0ng giao kh\xf4ng th\xe0nh c\xf4ng ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u01a1n h\xe0ng tr\u1ea3 h\xe0ng, ho\xe0n ti\u1ec1n. (L\u01b0u \xfd: Trong tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p \u0111\u01a1n h\xe0ng b\u1ecb h\u1ee7y ho\u1eb7c kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng y\xeau c\u1ea7u tr\u1ea3 h\xe0ng/ho\xe0n ti\u1ec1n, gi\xe1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01a1n h\xe0ng, chi ti\xeau t\u1eeb \u0111\u01a1n h\xe0ng n\xe0y s\u1ebd b\u1ecb tr\u1eeb kh\u1ecfi s\u1ed1 t\xedch l\u0169y tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\xf3. \u0110\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n ho\xe0n l\u1ea1i s\u1ebd b\u1eb1ng gi\xe1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01a1n h\xe0ng tr\u1eeb \u0111i cashback tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\xf3, s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n ho\xe0n l\u1ea1i = Ti\u1ec1n g\u1ed1c - Cashback).</li></ul>"},{"title":"Ki\u1ec3m tra h\u1ea1ng hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i \u1edf \u0111\xe2u? ","description":"<p style=\'font-size:14px; font-weight:400; line-height:150%; color:#757575;\'>Website Tiki.vn: B\u1ea1n c\xf3 th\u1ec3 ki\u1ec3m tra t\u1ea1i m\u1ee5c Tiki VIP b\xean c\u1ea1nh m\u1ee5c T\xe0i kho\u1ea3n ho\u1eb7c v\xe0o m\u1ee5c T\xe0i kho\u1ea3n \u21d2 Tiki VIP</br>App Tiki.vn: T\u1ea1i trang T\xe0i kho\u1ea3n, th\u1ee9 h\u1ea1ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb \u1edf d\u01b0\u1edbi t\xean v\xe0 c\u1ea1nh \u1ea3nh \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n</p>"},{"title":"N\u1ebfu \u0111\u01a1n h\xe0ng thanh to\xe1n b\u1eb1ng Tiki Xu t\u1eeb phi\u1ebfu qu\xe0 t\u1eb7ng th\xec c\xf3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\xednh v\xe0o t\u1ed5ng s\u1ed1 gi\xe1 tr\u1ecb chi ti\xeau h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7 kh\xf4ng?","description":"<p style=\'font-size:14px; font-weight:400; line-height:150%; color:#757575;\'>Gi\xe1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01a1n h\xe0ng thanh to\xe1n b\u1eb1ng Tiki Xu v\u1eabn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\xedch l\u0169y \u0111\u1ec3 x\xe9t duy\u1ec7t th\u1ee9 h\u1ea1ng</p>"},{"title":"N\u1ebfu t\xf4i \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n n\xe2ng h\u1ea1ng (10 \u0111\u01a1n h\xe0ng giao th\xe0nh c\xf4ng v\xe0 t\u1ed5ng chi ti\xeau 4 tri\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ed3ng) trong kho\u1ea3ng 1/7/2025 \u2013 1/9/2025, th\xec Tiki s\u1ebd n\xe2ng h\u1ea1ng l\xean Kim C\u01b0\u01a1ng ngay l\u1eadp t\u1ee9c hay t\xf4i ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u1ee3i \u0111\u1ebfn k\u1ef3 x\xe9t duy\u1ec7t ti\u1ebfp theo (01/01/2026)? N\u1ebfu \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c n\xe2ng ngay, h\u1ea1ng Kim C\u01b0\u01a1ng s\u1ebd c\xf3 hi\u1ec7u l\u1ef1c \u0111\u1ebfn bao gi\u1edd?","description":"<ul style=\'font-size:14px; font-weight:400; line-height:150%; color:#757575;\'><li>N\u1ebfu <b>01/09/2025</b>, b\u1ea1n ch\u1ea1m m\u1ed1c <b>10 \u0111\u01a1n h\xe0ng giao th\xe0nh c\xf4ng</b> v\xe0 <b>chi ti\xeau h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7 t\u1eeb 4,000,000 VN\u0110</b>, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c <b>n\xe2ng h\u1ea1ng Kim C\u01b0\u01a1ng</b> v\xe0o ng\xe0y 02/09/2025. H\u1ea1ng th\xe0nh vi\xean s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c duy tr\xec \u0111\u1ebfn h\u1ebft chu k\u1ef3 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i 31/12/2025, n\u1ebfu kh\xf4ng c\xf3 \u0111\u01a1n h\xe0ng b\u1ecb h\u1ee7y ho\u1eb7c ho\xe0n ti\u1ec1n.</li><li>N\u1ebfu ng\xe0y 03/09/2025 b\u1ea1n <b>ph\xe1t sinh \u0111\u01a1n h\u1ee7y/tr\u1ea3 h\xe0ng ho\xe0n ti\u1ec1n</b> d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ebfn b\u1ea1n kh\xf4ng c\xf2n \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n c\u1ee7a h\u1ea1ng Kim C\u01b0\u01a1ng, h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng s\u1ebd t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh l\u1ea1i h\u1ea1ng ph\xf9 h\u1ee3p, d\u1ef1a tr\xean t\u1ed5ng s\u1ed1 \u0111\u01a1n v\xe0 gi\xe1 tr\u1ecb chi ti\xeau t\xedch l\u0169y t\u1eeb \u0111\u1ea7u chu k\u1ef3.</li></ul></br><p style=\'font-size:14px; font-weight:400; line-height:150%; color:#757575;\'>\u26a0\ufe0f<b>L\u01b0u \xfd:</b></br>H\u1ea1ng trong chu k\u1ef3 n\xe0y <b>kh\xf4ng th\u1ea5p h\u01a1n h\u1ea1ng b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u1edf chu k\u1ef3 tr\u01b0\u1edbc.</b> V\xed d\u1ee5: n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u chu k\u1ef3 v\u1edbi h\u1ea1ng V\xe0ng, th\xec trong su\u1ed1t chu k\u1ef3 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i, h\u1ea1ng th\u1ea5p nh\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n v\u1eabn l\xe0 V\xe0ng.</p>"},{"title":"\u01afu \u0111\xe3i sinh nh\u1eadt \xe1p d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\xe0o?","description":"<p style=\'font-size:14px; font-weight:400; line-height:150%; color:#757575;\'>Khi b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ea1t t\u1eeb h\u1ea1ng Kim C\u01b0\u01a1ng v\xe0 c\xf3 ng\xe0y sinh nh\u1eadt \u0111\xe3 c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt trong h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 c\xe1 nh\xe2n, Tiki s\u1ebd g\u1eedi m\xe3 \u01b0u \u0111\xe3i trong th\xe1ng sinh nh\u1eadt. H\xe3y ch\u1eafc ch\u1eafn r\u1eb1ng b\u1ea1n \u0111\xe3 C\u1eadp nh\u1eadt ng\xe0y sinh</p>"},{"title":"L\xe0m sao \u0111\u1ec3 kh\xf4ng b\u1ecb h\u1ea1 h\u1ea1ng?","description":"<p style=\'font-size:14px; font-weight:400; line-height:150%; color:#757575;\'>B\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n duy tr\xec t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u s\u1ed1 \u0111\u01a1n h\xe0ng v\xe0 m\u1ee9c chi ti\xeau t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u1ee9ng v\u1edbi h\u1ea1ng hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i m\u1ed7i chu k\u1ef3 (6 th\xe1ng). N\u1ebfu kh\xf4ng \u0111\u1ea1t, h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng s\u1ebd \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh h\u1ea1ng theo th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf \u1edf chu k\u1ef3 ti\u1ebfp theo. Vi\u1ec7c kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng l\u1ea1i chu k\u1ef3 s\u1ebd di\u1ec5n ra v\xe0o 2 m\u1ed1c th\u1eddi gian quan tr\u1ecdng: 01/01 v\xe0 01/07 h\xe0ng n\u0103m.</p>"},{"title":"M\xe3 \u01b0u \u0111\xe3i theo h\u1ea1ng th\xe0nh vi\xean \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb \u1edf \u0111\xe2u tr\xean Tiki?","description":"<ul style=\'font-size:14px; font-weight:400; line-height:150%; color:#757575;\'><li>T\u1ea1i Gi\u1ecf h\xe0ng, trang Thanh to\xe1n</li><li>T\u1ea1i trang Chi ti\u1ebft s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m</li><li>T\u1ea1i trang M\xe3 gi\u1ea3m gi\xe1 c\u1ee7a t\xf4i</li></ul>"},{"title":"\u0110i\u1ec1u kho\u1ea3n v\xe0 \u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n c\u1ee7a Ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\xecnh Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng th\xe2n thi\u1ebft Tiki VIP?","description":"<p style=\'font-size:14px; font-weight:400; line-height:150%; color:#757575;\'>B\u1ea1n c\xf3 th\u1ec3 tham kh\u1ea3o th\xeam c\xe1c th\xf4ng tin kh\xe1c bao g\u1ed3m \u0110i\u1ec1u kho\u1ea3n & \u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n c\u1ee7a Ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\xecnh Kh\xe1ch h\xe0ng th\xe2n thi\u1ebft Tiki VIP t\u1ea1i <a href=\'https://tiki.vn/thong-tin/tikivip-chuong-trinh-khach-hang-than-thiet\' style=\'color: #000; text-decoration: underline;\'>https://tiki.vn/thong-tin/tikivip-chuong-trinh-khach-hang-than-thiet</a></p>"},{"title":"V\xec sao trang s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb gi\xe1 \u01b0u \u0111\xe3i t\u1eeb m\xe3 VIP nh\u01b0ng khi t\xf4i th\xeam v\xe0o gi\u1ecf h\xe0ng v\xe0 thanh to\xe1n gi\xe1 l\u1ea1i cao h\u01a1n?","description":"<p style=\'font-size:14px; font-weight:400; line-height:150%; color:#757575;\'>Gi\xe1 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb tr\xean trang s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\xe0 m\u1ee9c gi\xe1 \u01b0u \u0111\xe3i t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t khi c\xf3 \xe1p d\u1ee5ng m\xe3 gi\u1ea3m gi\xe1 VIP. Tuy nhi\xean, c\xe1c m\xe3 gi\u1ea3m gi\xe1 VIP c\xf3 gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n l\u01b0\u1ee3t s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng. N\u1ebfu t\xe0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\xe3 d\xf9ng h\u1ebft l\u01b0\u1ee3t ho\u1eb7c kh\xf4ng c\xf2n m\xe3 ph\xf9 h\u1ee3p, s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\xednh theo gi\xe1 b\xe1n khi thanh to\xe1n.</p>"}],"special_coupon_tags":[{"text":"Kim c\u01b0\u01a1ng","type":"diamond","badge":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/ta/0d/43/5f/0a8ead3619f01a2ba5ce537160508483.png"},{"text":"V\xe0ng","type":"gold","badge":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/ta/96/fd/67/a238594c7b8648020523fdce51428116.png"}],"vip_point_icons":{"member":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/ta/5a/27/d6/294d2ea40776bc8440e2bc07f4d9faed.png","gold":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/upload/70/ea/20/d8f83f676ac28e454e7d3adafa88750f.png","diamond":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/upload/80/f7/c6/b04615649d908d75e10d37fed912303b.png"}}'),f="".concat(s,".globalConfig"),p=(0,c.i5)({actionType:"".concat(s.toUpperCase(),"_").concat(l),stateKey:f,initialState:d,effect:(0,r.Z)(a().mark((function t(){var e,n,r,o,i,c,s,l,d,f;return a().wrap((function(t){for(;;)switch(t.prev=t.next){case 0:return t.next=2,(0,u.F)({url:"".concat("https://api.tiki.vn/brickv2/api","/public/campaigns/slug/thong-tin%2Fglobalconfig"),method:"GET"});case 2:return e=t.sent,t.prev=3,l=JSON.parse(null===e||void 0===e||null===(n=e.data)||void 0===n||null===(r=n.pages)||void 0===r||null===(o=r[0])||void 0===o||null===(i=o.widgets)||void 0===i||null===(c=i[0])||void 0===c?void 0:c.payload),f=null!==(d=JSON.parse(null===l||void 0===l||null===(s=l.paragraph)||void 0===s?void 0:s.text))&&void 0!==d?d:{},t.abrupt("return",f);case 11:return t.prev=11,t.t0=t.catch(3),t.abrupt("return",{});case 14:case"end":return t.stop()}}),t,null,[[3,11]])}))),opts:{reducers:[